  speakerName: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0fcb4f4247841f844a4ed3948dae66cf, type: 2}
  icon: {fileID: 0}
  portugueseText: "O que estava na vis\xE3o dos irm\xE3os era real, eles viviam sob
    uma ditadura militar, e seus pais estavam sendo perseguidos pelo regime, e uma
    tropa de soldados estava fazendo uma queima de arquivo no jornal, queimando evid\xEAncias
    de seus crimes e eliminando qualquer detrator que fosse encontrado ali. "
  englishText: What the siblings were seeing was real; they were living under a military
    dictatorship, their parents were being persecuted by the regime, and a troop
    of soldiers was carrying out a cover-up at the newspaper, burning evidence of
    their crimes and eliminating any detractors they could find there.
